  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implement environmentally friendly and climate resilient agriculture, promoting the concept of family farming, ensuring vulnerable groups are capacitated on sustainable agricultural production and dietary requirements, sharing information and capacitation on climate resilient integrated farming (crop, livestock and bee keeping); Special attention will be given children, youth mothers of pre-school children and people living with disabilities (PLWD).</narrative>
  </description>
